      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You'll want to frame the audit not as a passing grade, but as a snapshot of a *current* state, which is inherently limited. Position the \"Advanced Continuous Monitoring\" package as the necessary evolution from a static check-up to proactive, real-time defense against emerging threats. Emphasize that while their foundation is strong, the landscape is changing daily, and only the premium tier offers the foresight needed to stay ahead of tomorrow's vulnerabilities.",
      "source": "target",
