      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Focus on the *potential* for risk, rather than existing failures. Point to the lack of automated, predictive analytics in their current setup, suggesting their existing monitoring is purely reactive—it only tells them *after* something happens. You can frame this as a gap in operational efficiency, noting that the premium tier integrates predictive modeling that anticipates weaknesses before they become exploitable incidents. This shifts the conversation from \"fixing a problem\" to \"achieving peak operational excellence.\"",
      "source": "target",
